{
  "id": "explore-reading-and-understanding-a-dashboard-lj-preview",
  "title": "Read a dashboard: rows and unclear panels (preview)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore dashboards on Grafana Play to see which panels a row groups together, and where a panel's title or unit leaves a viewer unsure what it shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore the rows on Time series graphs to see which panels each row groups together and how a row's heading stays visible when its contents are hidden."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "rows",
      "title": "Rows on Time series graphs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000016/time-series-graphs?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open the **Time series graphs** dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Focus on the **Interpolation modes** row heading.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This row groups the panels **Interpolation mode: smooth**, **Interpolation mode: Step before**, and **Interpolation mode: Step after**, along with a text panel that explains the interpolation modes."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes']) svg",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Interpolation modes** arrow to collapse the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The row's panels are hidden. The heading stays visible so you can expand the row again."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes']) svg",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Interpolation modes** arrow again to expand the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button:has([data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Soft min & max'])",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Find the **Soft min & max** row heading.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This row groups four panels about minimum and maximum values."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-430']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Notice the text panel in the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The text explains why a hard minimum and maximum can hide a spike, and what a soft minimum and maximum do. The row groups it with the panels it describes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore panels on Grafana Play to see where a repeated title or a missing unit leaves a viewer unsure what a panel shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "unclear-sample-website",
      "title": "Sample Website Dashboard",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000003/sample-website-dashboard?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open the **Sample Website Dashboard**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-31']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the first **Google hits** panel, a gauge."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-24']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Find the second **Google hits** panel, a bar gauge."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Two panels share the title **Google hits**, so the title doesn't say which panel shows what."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-5']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000003",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Notice the **client side full page load** panel."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This panel has no unit set, so its values appear as plain numbers. A viewer can't tell whether they are seconds, milliseconds, or something else."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "unclear-business-metrics",
      "title": "Business Metrics",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000110/business-metrics?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open the **Business Metrics** dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-4']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000110",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "View the first **Payments Completed/s** panel, a time series."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-20']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000110",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true,
          "content": "Focus on the second **Payments Completed/s** panel, a stat."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Two panels share the title **Payments Completed/s**, so the title doesn't say which panel shows what."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
